// Title: Webshell ReGeorg Detection Via Web Logs
// ID: 2ea44a60-cfda-11ea-87d0-0242ac130003
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Cian Heasley
// Date: 2020-08-04
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1505.003
// Description: Certain strings in the uri_query field when combined with null referer and null user agent can indicate activity associated with the webshell ReGeorg.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (((cs-uri-query like "*_cmd=read*" or cs-uri-query like "*_connect&target*" or cs-uri-query like "*_cmd=connect*" or cs-uri-query like "*_cmd=disconnect*" or cs-uri-query like "*_cmd=forward*")) and (cs-referer == null and cs-user-agent == null and cs-method == "POST"))
